xnu 0503: open the speaker device graph on the adsp apm

Port the zizhan AudioReach graph builders (BSD-2-Clause-Patent,
ShengAudioReach.c and ShengAudioReach.h) into mondrian_audioreach.c and
mondrian_audioreach.h: the subgraph, container, module and parameter
encoding, the speaker device graph (subgraph 0x4005 with one I2S sink,
instance 0x6051) and the answer parser. When the APM reports the SPF
ready the worker opens that graph, configures the endpoint for 48 kHz
32-bit stereo on the tertiary MI2S SD0 with the internal word select
(the live device tree muxes only that data line, and the two AW88261
amplifiers share it as a stereo pair), logs both statuses and closes
the graph again. No clock, data line or amplifier is started.
